{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"综合微分几何讲稿"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"讲义"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"SDG-notes"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>这一系列是我 2023 年 7 月参加国际基础科学大会期间, 住在集贤山庄时, 与同学们交流所写的讲稿.</p>\n<p>"},{"Embed":{"url":"SDG-0-SIAM.md","title":null,"option":{"numbering":false,"details_open":false,"catalog":true}}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Embed":{"url":"SDG-1-D.md","title":null,"option":{"numbering":false,"details_open":false,"catalog":true}}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Embed":{"url":"SDG-2-int.md","title":null,"option":{"numbering":false,"details_open":false,"catalog":true}}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Embed":{"url":"SDG-3-man.md","title":null,"option":{"numbering":false,"details_open":false,"catalog":true}}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Embed":{"url":"SDG-4-tan.md","title":null,"option":{"numbering":false,"details_open":false,"catalog":true}}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Embed":{"url":"SDG-4-Weil.md","title":null,"option":{"numbering":false,"details_open":false,"catalog":true}}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Embed":{"url":"SDG-5-diff.md","title":null,"option":{"numbering":false,"details_open":false,"catalog":true}}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}